    "body": "We are working on this in Draft #298\r\n\r\nThe recent changes in Qiskit have been somewhat abrupt, particularly with the deprecation of the older primitives. Some other packages have also not been updated yet, so Fidelity Kernels might not work after we fix everything in sQUlearn.\r\nWe are optimistic that a new release will be ready by mid-next week.",
